  "prefLabel": "Cub 301.04 Contiguous parcels",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 301.04 “Contiguous parcels” means more than one parcel of land, having identical ownership, which is connected, disregarding whether it is divided by a highway, railbed, river, or water body or the boundary of a political subdivision.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
